## 1.1.0 — 02-09-2026

### Added
- new rule CAUSE_BLOCK_FALL has been added — it affects block categories subject to gravity (sand, gravel, anvils, dragon eggs, dripstone, etc.). If an attacker attempts to drop them onto a prohibited region, they will be destroyed without dropping any items.

### Bugfix
- Fixed the bug, that allowed players to install scaffolding in the region territory, who have the BUILD rule disabled.

- Other technical improvements related to the tracking system.